Tests for 0104. DCS motion fixtures: a fourth and fifth composition per scene (the shipping one and the flow alone with the
quality options, XRFG_TEST_FG_QUALITY=<bits>, all by default), the MVs' fallback share, a byte-for-byte check that an option
that cannot act on a scene changes nothing, XRFG_TEST_SRGB_VIEW=1 (every scene through an sRGB view), XRFG_TEST_DUMP_DIR
(PPM dumps). New scenes: the occlusion at night (a grey aircraft 0.02-0.06 over a 0.002 sky, MVs at 10 and 3 pixels a
texel, UNORM and sRGB views; the trailing copy asserted at most a quarter with dcs_motion_sky_occlusion), the world beside a
cockpit mask's blocks, a still HUD over a dark and over a bright rolling sky (no worse with the options; with
dcs_motion_hud_guard no worse than the flow alone) and a contrail at an aircraft over the dark sky. synthesize_nvidia_pair:
a view format and XRFG_TEST_FG_QUALITY_ALL_PAIRS. DCS motion bench: XRFG_TEST_FG_QUALITY_BENCH=<bits> (both pipelines
with MVs, the second with the options; pack, flow, whole-pair medians). Live ini parse test for the quality keys.

